OL,3,GNEWSAShops v shoplifters - who is
OL,4,Awinning the battle?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's absolutely relentless, multiple
OL,7,Ftimes a day with multiple offenders.
OL,8,FThe same people just come back and back
OL,9,Fand back."
OL,11,FLou Genever has run a shop in the
OL,12,Fcentre of Gloucester for the past 20
OL,13,Fyears and says the problem of
OL,14,Fshoplifting has never been as bad as it
OL,15,Fis now.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
