OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAShops v shoplifters - who is
OL,4,Awinning the battle?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest figures obtained by the BBC
OL,7,Ffrom police data appear to back up her
OL,8,Ffeelings. They show that in 2025-26
OL,9,FGloucestershire saw an 8.2% rise in
OL,10,Fcrime, one of 11 police forces
OL,11,Fnationwide to see a year-on-year
OL,12,Fincrease.
OL,14,FBut police in the West say they want
OL,15,Fmore businesses to report crimes which,
OL,16,Falthough it might make their figures
OL,17,Fworse, would help with prosecutions.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
